OL,3,GNEWSATown set to unveil statue of Susie
OL,4,Athe wandering cat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town is preparing for the unveiling
OL,7,Fof the long-awaited statue of a beloved
OL,8,Froaming feline.
OL,10,FOn Sunday, residents, artists, writers,
OL,11,Fmusicians and animal lovers in
OL,12,FDorchester, Dorset, will gather to
OL,13,Fcelebrate Susie the cat, whose
OL,14,Fadventures have brought joy to the
OL,15,Fcommunity.
OL,17,FHer bronze statue by Weymouth-based
OL,18,Fsculptor Ama Menec will be unveiled
OL,19,Foutside Julia's House Charity on 44
OL,20,FSouth Street at midday.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
