OL,3,GNEWSATown set to unveil statue of Susie
OL,4,Athe wandering cat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSusie will be immortalised as a
OL,7,FRoman-era cat as a nod to the town's
OL,8,Forigins and geology, with Roman-style
OL,9,Fbeads around her neck and a tile
OL,10,Ffeaturing her paw prints.
